    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.poster.avif?t=1750889235\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.webm?t=1750889235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.mp4?t=1750889235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.poster.avif?t=1750889235\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.webm?t=1750889235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235830/extras/e1ddc87d8200775abe92ff64068a9a34.mp4?t=1750889235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>",
